  "review": {
    "imagery": "Root reviewed all 74 original brochure spreads, forty extracted native resources and twenty current website candidates. Thirty-two selected native renders retain their villa, residence, penthouse or shared-community scope. Original embedded image bytes and physical pages are preserved. Stock lifestyle material, icons, material boards and repetitive alternate views were excluded. Depicted facilities and finishes remain proposed.",
    "floorPlans": "Root reviewed all twenty-one delivered complete sheets, the four matching villa layouts on brochure pages 38/39/41/42, both original villa area panels, and every apartment/penthouse area panel. Select 171.90 + 194.09 = 365.99 m² and Shore 298.04 + 292.47 = 590.51 m². Four standalone villa levels match the brochure home families and retain no separate level-area total. Eleven apartment/penthouse printed totals are 93,100,143,151,160,133,190,237,258,397,402 m². Type 2D 175 + 82 = 257 conflicts with printed 258 and remains disputed. All other residential component sums agree. Villa staff/driver rooms are separate from headline bedrooms. Apartment notices retain the original template villa wording. Current townhome drawings were unavailable. Original source PDFs and complete notices are retained with physical-page links.",
    "location": "Root read the current complete official SVG and original brochure regional and three master-plan sheets. The SVG differentiates Marina, Villas and Residences. The overlapping mosque, airport and ADGM estimates agree. Louvre 35 and proposed Disneyland 30 are current-map figures. Brochure-only Saadiyat 35, Al Maktoum 75 and Downtown Dubai 90 retain their separate source scope. No final home coordinate, operational marina entitlement, journey mode, live route or kilometre distance was invented. The generic Hudayriyat sales centre is omitted as a home entrance.",
    "provenance": "Normal-GET receipts preserve source URLs, dates, original PDF/native-image/SVG bytes and SHA256. The selected regional PNG is a complete rasterization of the retained original SVG. PDF parser wrong-object-offset warnings were recorded during extraction. All selected resources and rendered complete pages were visually checked after extraction. Facts/payment artwork remains historical researched evidence and was excluded from the drawing selector. Existing researched commercial data and protected identities remain unchanged."
  },
